{"seq":3,"slug":"indirect-spend-visibility-maverick","title":"间接支出可视性与散单(maverick)识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/indirect-spend-category/indirect-spend-visibility-maverick","wordCount":2479,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"间接支出可视性与散单-maverick-识别\">间接支出可视性与散单(maverick)识别</h1><p>一家集团财务说「我们的间接支出管理得很好」，追问一句「那你们一年在间接品类上花了多少」，如果答不上来或者答案是采购系统里那个数，那管理得好这句话就不成立。因为采购系统里的数字只是全部花销的一部分——报销单里的、公司卡刷的、供应商直寄账单后财务直接付款的、以及子公司用自己 ERP 买的，都在系统之外。<strong>支出一旦不可见，节省、合规、议价这三件事全部无从谈起。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可见性的三个层次与数据来源\">核心概念：可见性的三个层次与数据来源</h2><h3 id=\"四类数据源与它们的盲区\">四类数据源与它们的盲区</h3><p>可见性不是有或没有的二值，而是三个递进的层次。<strong>第一层是金额可见</strong>：知道某一品类一年一共花了多少。<strong>第二层是结构可见</strong>：知道这笔钱由哪些供应商、哪些法人、哪些成本中心贡献。<strong>第三层是合法可见</strong>：知道这笔花的采购动作是否走了该走的路径（协议价、准入供应商、必要审批）。绝大多数企业只做到第一层，做到第二层就能找出谈判机会，做到第三层才能计算合规率。</p>\n<p>支出分析在实践中被归纳为三个支柱——可见性、分析、流程，并回答「花了什么、花给了谁、承诺的价值有没有拿到」三个问题；它的直接驱动通常是利润改善，也就是找出新的节省机会并守住已经谈下来的节省（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spend_analysis\">Spend analysis</a>）。这三个支柱解释了为什么「可见性」必须排在「分析」之前：分类器再准，输入的数据源本身有缺口时，分析结果也只是在错误的分母上做精细运算。</p>\n<p>三个层次对应四类数据源，任何一类缺失都会在报表上留下盲区。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>覆盖内容</th>\n<th>典型颗粒度</th>\n<th>主要缺口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采购系统（PO / 请购）</td>\n<td>走系统的目录与询价采购</td>\n<td>行项目级</td>\n<td>完全不覆盖线下采购</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>员工报销</td>\n<td>员工垫付的小额采购</td>\n<td>单笔级</td>\n<td>无商品编码，只有文字摘要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公司卡账单</td>\n<td>刷卡消费</td>\n<td>交易级</td>\n<td>商户名不规范，无明细行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应付账款（发票 / 直付）</td>\n<td>供应商直开发票、订阅扣款</td>\n<td>发票级</td>\n<td>事后入账，无采购前置校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四类数据的<strong>主键互不相通</strong>是最核心的技术难点。采购系统里的一次采购有物料编码，报销单里只有「办公用品若干」这样的文字，公司卡账单里只有「XX 文具店」。把它们归并到同一个品类维度上，需要三层处理：先按<strong>供应商主数据</strong>归一（同一个供应商的不同拼写合并到同一个 party_id），再按<strong>品类分类器</strong>给无编码的记录打上推断品类，最后按<strong>金额与时间窗口</strong>做去重（同一笔采购既出现在公司卡又在报销单时不能重复计入）。第三层尤其容易出错，因为它要求系统知道「这笔刷卡对应的就是那张报销单」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采购系统 PO] --&gt; E[供应商主数据归一]&#10;  B[员工报销] --&gt; E&#10;  C[公司卡账单] --&gt; E&#10;  D[应付发票/直付] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[品类分类器&lt;br/&gt;规则+模型推断]&#10;  F --&gt; G{是否重复计数}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[去重合并]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[进入支出立方]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[品类×供应商×主体×期间]\">graph TD\n  A[采购系统 PO] --&gt; E[供应商主数据归一]\n  B[员工报销] --&gt; E\n  C[公司卡账单] --&gt; E\n  D[应付发票/直付] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[品类分类器&lt;br/&gt;规则+模型推断]\n  F --&gt; G{是否重复计数}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[去重合并]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[进入支出立方]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[品类×供应商×主体×期间]</pre><p>支出立方（spend cube）就是这张图的终点：一个以品类、供应商、法人主体、成本中心、期间为维度的多面聚合，它才是后续一切分析的数据底座。支出立方这个说法来自支出分析实践，它的三个经典维度是「不同供应商之间的支出对比」「采购该品类的成本中心或利益相关方」以及「组织购买的品类」，价格与数量位于立方中心（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spend_analysis\">Spend analysis</a>）。本 hub 的模型在这三维之外多加了「法人主体」与「期间」两维，因为跨境集团必须能回答「同一笔预算在不同主体上被谁花掉了」这个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"散单的定义必须是一个可计算的指标\">散单的定义必须是一个可计算的指标</h2><h3 id=\"三个必要条件的交集\">三个必要条件的交集</h3><p>「散单」在中文里常被当成道德评价（这个人不听话），但工程上它必须是一个可计算的比率，否则无法治理。可行的定义是<strong>三个条件的交集</strong>：该笔支出未走采购系统、该品类存在已生效的协议或目录、金额超过一个可忽略阈值。三个条件缺一不可——没有第二个条件，任何自有渠道采购都会被误判（有些品类本来就没有协议）；没有第三个条件，一杯咖啡也会被算成违规。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>maverick_rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mtext>未走系统</mtext><mo>∩</mo><mtext>有协议品类</mtext><mo>∩</mo><mtext>金额</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>amount</mtext></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>该品类总支出</mtext></munder><mtext>amount</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{maverick\\_rate} = \\frac{\\sum_{\\text{未走系统} \\cap \\text{有协议品类} \\cap \\text{金额} &gt; \\theta} \\text{amount}}{\\sum_{\\text{该品类总支出}} \\text{amount}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">maverick_rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4528em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4671em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">该品类总支出</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">未走系统</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∩</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">有协议品类</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∩</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">金额</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个定义有个重要性质：它<strong>随协议覆盖率的提高而上升</strong>。当协议覆盖率从 30% 提到 70% 时，分母里被纳入统计的品类变多了，如果线下采购没有同步减少，散单率会显示为「变差」。这不是指标骗人，而是说明覆盖率与合规率必须成对看——只有覆盖率上升同时散单率下降，才说明治理有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"识别散单的四类信号\">识别散单的四类信号</h2><h3 id=\"信号可靠度与冷启动约束\">信号可靠度与冷启动约束</h3><p>把散单从数据里挑出来，靠的是四类信号，它们的可靠度依次下降。</p>\n<p><strong>信号一是报销单中的供应商命中协议名单。</strong> 员工用报销买了协议供应商的东西，说明他知道该供应商但没走系统，或者走系统的路径比报销更麻烦。这类信号最可靠。</p>\n<p><strong>信号二是同品类价格离散度异常。</strong> 在某个品类上，如果同一个 SKU 在不同订单间的单价标准差超出正常范围，说明存在非协议价采购。这个信号需要先有足够的历史样本，冷启动阶段不可用。</p>\n<p><strong>信号三是协议供应商份额下降。</strong> 某品类的总支出中，协议供应商占比低于目标值，差额部分即为可疑散单，即便无法定位到具体哪一笔。</p>\n<p><strong>信号四是公司卡在采购品类的刷卡频次。</strong> 公司卡本来用于差旅，若在办公用品商户上频繁出现，说明这个品类被线下渠道渗透。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>数据要求</th>\n<th>可靠度</th>\n<th>可定位到单据</th>\n<th>冷启动可用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>报销命中协议供应商</td>\n<td>供应商主数据</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同品类价格离散</td>\n<td>≥30 笔历史订单</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议份额缺口</td>\n<td>协议覆盖率数据</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公司卡品类刷卡</td>\n<td>卡账单商户分类</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把散单治理转成路径优化问题\">把散单治理转成路径优化问题</h2><h3 id=\"对发起人而言节省额近似为零\">对发起人而言节省额近似为零</h3><p>识别出散单之后最常见的错误动作是「通报批评并加强审批」。这几乎必然失败，因为它没有改变一个事实：<strong>走系统的路径仍然比绕过去更慢</strong>。员工绕系统的动机可以用一个极简的效用比较表达。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>system</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>bypass</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>saving</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>steps</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{\\text{system}} - U_{\\text{bypass}} = (p_{\\text{saving}} \\cdot q) - c_{\\text{steps}} - w_{\\text{wait}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">system</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bypass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">saving</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">steps</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>saving</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{saving}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">saving</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是走系统能省下的钱（对员工个人几乎为零，因为省的是公司的钱），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 是他能感知到的比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>steps</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{steps}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">steps</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是操作步数成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{wait}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是等待审批的时间成本。这个式子的工程含义直白：<strong>右边可优化的只有后两项</strong>。因为对发起人来说 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>saving</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{saving}} \\cdot q \\approx 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">saving</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，所以治理只有一个方向——把步数和等待压到最低。任何不减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>steps</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{steps}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">steps</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{wait}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的治理手段，效果都只是让违规更隐蔽（比如把采购拆到更低金额以避开审批），而不是让违规消失。</p>\n<p>具体到产品上，这意味着三件事优先于一切：目录要能覆盖员工想买的东西（否则他必然去别处买）、下单要能在三步内完成（搜索、加购、提交）、审批要在金额阈值内免批（阈值设置见 <a href=\"../indirect-budget-settlement/cost-center-budget-control\">成本中心/项目预算与超额审批</a>）。目录本身的形态选择决定了覆盖能力，见 <a href=\"../catalog-eprocurement-p2p/internal-catalog-punchout-osp\">内部采购商城与 punch-out 供应商目录</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"支出分析的最小可用数据模型\">支出分析的最小可用数据模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 支出事实表：所有来源归一后的唯一入口&#10;CREATE TABLE spend_fact (&#10;  spend_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  source_type     VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- po / expense / card / ap_invoice&#10;  source_ref      VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,   -- 来源单据 ID，用于溯源&#10;  party_id        BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES party(party_id),&#10;  category_id     VARCHAR(32) REFERENCES indirect_category(category_id),&#10;  category_conf   NUMERIC(3,2),           -- 分类置信度，&lt;0.8 需人工复核&#10;  legal_entity_id VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  cost_center_id  VARCHAR(32),&#10;  amount_base     NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL, -- 折本币&#10;  currency        CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  posted_period   CHAR(7) NOT NULL,       -- YYYY-MM&#10;  has_contract    BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  is_maverick     BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  dedup_group_id  VARCHAR(64),            -- 同一笔采购的跨来源去重键&#10;  UNIQUE (source_type, source_ref)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_spend_cube ON spend_fact&#10;  (category_id, legal_entity_id, posted_period) INCLUDE (amount_base, party_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 支出事实表：所有来源归一后的唯一入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spend_fact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  spend_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- po / expense / card / ap_invoice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 来源单据 ID，用于溯源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  party_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> party(party_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indirect_category(category_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_conf   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分类置信度，&#x3C;0.8 需人工复核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_center_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_base     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 折本币</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posted_period   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- YYYY-MM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  has_contract    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_maverick     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dedup_group_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同一笔采购的跨来源去重键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source_type, source_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_spend_cube</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spend_fact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (category_id, legal_entity_id, posted_period) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INCLUDE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount_base, party_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>category_conf</code> 字段是这套模型诚实性的关键：分类器对报销单文字摘要推断出的品类，其置信度天然低于采购系统的显式编码，把它显式记下来，报表就可以只统计高出置信度的部分，而不是把推断结果当成事实。<code>dedup_group_id</code> 处理同一笔采购的跨来源重复，例如公司卡刷卡与后续报销单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>间接支出可见性分金额、结构、合法三层，需要把采购系统、报销、公司卡、应付发票四类数据源归一到同一支出立方；散单必须定义为「未走系统 + 有协议品类 + 超阈值」的可计算比率，并理解它会随协议覆盖率上升而先升后降；识别散单靠四类可靠度不同的信号；治理的唯一有效方向是压低操作步数与等待时间，因为对发起人来说节省额收益近似为零。这套度量口径是第四章 <a href=\"../indirect-budget-settlement/indirect-saving-compliance-kpi\">间接采购节省/合规率与品类 KPI</a> 的输入。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可见性分金额、结构、合法三层，靠四类数据源归一到支出立方</li>\n<li>散单是可计算比率：未走系统且品类有协议且金额超阈值的交集</li>\n<li>治理方向只有一个——压低操作步数与等待时间，因为对发起人节省额收益近似为零</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"间接支出可视性与散单(maverick)识别","id":"间接支出可视性与散单-maverick-识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可见性的三个层次与数据来源","id":"核心概念-可见性的三个层次与数据来源"},{"level":3,"text":"四类数据源与它们的盲区","id":"四类数据源与它们的盲区"},{"level":2,"text":"散单的定义必须是一个可计算的指标","id":"散单的定义必须是一个可计算的指标"},{"level":3,"text":"三个必要条件的交集","id":"三个必要条件的交集"},{"level":2,"text":"识别散单的四类信号","id":"识别散单的四类信号"},{"level":3,"text":"信号可靠度与冷启动约束","id":"信号可靠度与冷启动约束"},{"level":2,"text":"把散单治理转成路径优化问题","id":"把散单治理转成路径优化问题"},{"level":3,"text":"对发起人而言节省额近似为零","id":"对发起人而言节省额近似为零"},{"level":2,"text":"支出分析的最小可用数据模型","id":"支出分析的最小可用数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直接采购与间接采购的流程差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/indirect-spend-category/direct-vs-indirect-procurement"},"next":{"title":"内部采购商城与 punch-out 供应商目录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/catalog-eprocurement-p2p/internal-catalog-punchout-osp"}}